/* 沟通页：灰底，官方客服一条凹槽行，会话按「有未读 / 进行中 / 已结束」分组，行与行只用细线隔开。 */
.info-page { min-height:100vh; box-sizing:border-box; padding:0 0 var(--xy-fixed-tab-clearance); background:var(--xy-color-page); color:var(--xy-color-text-primary); }
.info-content { padding-top:var(--xy-space-3); }
.support-wrap { padding:0 var(--xy-space-4); }
.support-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:var(--xy-space-3); width:100%; min-height:var(--xy-size-touch-min); margin:0; padding:var(--xy-space-2) var(--xy-space-3); box-sizing:border-box; border-radius:var(--xy-radius-control); background:var(--xy-color-well); text-align:left; }
.support-row:active { opacity:var(--xy-opacity-pressed); }
.support-icon-wrap { display:flex; flex:none; width:calc(var(--xy-size-icon-feature) - var(--xy-space-1)); height:calc(var(--xy-size-icon-feature) - var(--xy-space-1)); align-items:center; justify-content:center; border-radius:var(--xy-radius-control); background:var(--xy-color-brand); }
.support-icon { width:var(--xy-size-icon-base); height:var(--xy-size-icon-base); }
.support-copy-wrap { display:flex; min-width:0; flex:1; flex-direction:column; }
.support-name { color:var(--xy-color-text-primary); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.support-copy { color:var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); }
.support-arrow { flex:none; color:var(--xy-color-text-disabled); font-size:var(--xy-text-section-title-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-section-title-line-height); }
.seg { display:flex; gap:var(--xy-space-0-5); margin:var(--xy-space-3) var(--xy-space-4) 0; padding:var(--xy-space-0-5); border-radius:var(--xy-radius-control); background:var(--xy-color-border); }
.seg-item { position:relative; display:flex; flex:1; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:var(--xy-button-height-small); border-radius:var(--xy-radius-sm); color:var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size:var(--xy-text-section-title-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-section-title-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-medium); }
.seg-item.is-on { background:var(--xy-color-surface); color:var(--xy-color-text-primary); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-bold); box-shadow:var(--xy-shadow-segment); }
.cgroup { margin-top:var(--xy-space-4); }
.cgroup-title { display:flex; gap:var(--xy-space-1); padding:0 var(--xy-space-4) var(--xy-space-2); color:var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); }
.conversation-list { padding-left:var(--xy-space-4); border-top:1rpx solid var(--xy-color-divider); border-bottom:1rpx solid var(--xy-color-divider); background:var(--xy-color-page); }
.conversation-row { position:relative; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; width:100%; min-height:var(--xy-size-touch-min); margin:0; padding:var(--xy-space-3) var(--xy-space-4) var(--xy-space-3) 0; gap:var(--xy-space-3); box-sizing:border-box; text-align:left; }
.conversation-row:active { opacity:var(--xy-opacity-pressed); }
.conversation-row + .conversation-row::before { content:""; position:absolute; top:0; right:0; left:calc(var(--xy-size-icon-nav) * 2 - var(--xy-space-1) + var(--xy-space-3)); height:1rpx; background:var(--xy-color-divider); }
.conversation-avatar { display:flex; flex:none; width:calc(var(--xy-size-icon-nav) * 2 - var(--xy-space-1) * 1); height:calc(var(--xy-size-icon-nav) * 2 - var(--xy-space-1) * 1); align-items:center; justify-content:center; overflow:hidden; border-radius:50%; background:var(--xy-color-brand-soft); color:var(--xy-color-brand); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-size); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.conversation-avatar image { width:100%; height:100%; }
.conversation-copy { display:flex; min-width:0; flex:1; flex-direction:column; gap:var(--xy-space-1); }
.line1,.line2,.line3 { display:flex; align-items:center; min-width:0; gap:var(--xy-space-2); }
.conversation-name { min-width:0; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; color:var(--xy-color-text-strong); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.conversation-role { flex:none; padding:0 var(--xy-inset-chip-compact-x); border-radius:var(--xy-radius-sm); background:var(--xy-color-well); color:var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); }
.conversation-time { flex:none; margin-left:auto; color:var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
.chip { flex:none; padding:0 var(--xy-inset-chip-compact-x); border-radius:var(--xy-radius-sm); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.chip--ok { background:var(--xy-color-brand-soft); color:var(--xy-color-brand); }
.chip--warn { background:var(--xy-color-key-warning-soft); color:var(--xy-color-key-warning); }
.chip--wait { background:var(--xy-color-info-light); color:var(--xy-color-info); }
.chip--end { background:var(--xy-color-well); color:var(--xy-color-text-secondary); }
.line2-text { min-width:0; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; color:var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); }
.conversation-preview { min-width:0; flex:1; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; color:var(--xy-color-text-value); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.conversation-unread { flex:none; min-width:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); padding:0 var(--xy-space-1); box-sizing:border-box; border-radius:var(--xy-radius-pill); background:var(--xy-color-danger); color:var(--xy-color-text-inverse); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); text-align:center; font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
.is-end .conversation-name,.is-end .conversation-preview { color:var(--xy-color-text-secondary); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-regular); }
.is-end .conversation-avatar { opacity:.7; }
.info-text-action { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-width:var(--xy-size-touch-min); min-height:var(--xy-size-touch-min); margin:0; padding:0 var(--xy-space-2); background:transparent; color:var(--xy-color-brand); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.info-feedback { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:var(--xy-space-2); margin-top:var(--xy-space-2); color:var(--xy-color-danger); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); }
.info-loading { margin-top:var(--xy-space-3); padding:var(--xy-space-6) var(--xy-space-4); border-radius:var(--xy-radius-container); background:var(--xy-color-surface); color:var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-small-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-small-line-height); text-align:center; }
.info-empty { min-height:360px; margin-top:0; padding:var(--xy-space-6) var(--xy-space-4); border-radius:var(--xy-radius-container); background:var(--xy-color-surface); }
.info-empty .xy-empty-page__illustration { width:200px; max-width:100%; height:150px; margin-bottom:var(--xy-space-3); }
.info-empty .xy-empty-page__copy { margin-top:var(--xy-space-1); }
.info-order-action { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:var(--xy-size-touch-min); margin:var(--xy-space-4) 0 0; padding:0 var(--xy-space-6); border-radius:var(--xy-radius-md); background:var(--xy-color-brand); color:var(--xy-color-text-inverse); font-size:var(--xy-text-body-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-body-line-height); font-weight:var(--xy-text-weight-semibold); }
.info-order-action:active { background:var(--xy-color-brand-pressed); }
.directory-more { width:100%; border-top:1rpx solid var(--xy-color-divider); }
.directory-end { display:block; padding:var(--xy-space-3); border-top:1rpx solid var(--xy-color-divider); color:var(--xy-color-text-muted); font-size:var(--xy-text-caption-size); line-height:var(--xy-text-caption-line-height); text-align:center; }
.hit-area { position:absolute; left:0; right:0; top:50%; min-height:var(--xy-size-touch-min); transform:translateY(-50%); }
